"n":"#287","p":12,"im":["2c6535d2ef9c5d6764e0f3bf2aa6efc12ca576b8"],"fa":"دلم می‌خواست فروش BMW بگیرم؛ همه‌چیز را علامت زده بودم ولی یادم رفت آلارم بگذارم.","ib":{"2c6535d2ef9c5d6764e0f3bf2aa6efc12ca576b8":1},"m":287},{"id":"eurotrash_p12_288","t":"This one shows that patience would have paid of better","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#288","p":12,"im":["f25c68e83b315e2162daf83588c19ebe563d475e","a1fcd49caae5b4aa042ccfcbc6de4366e4e1f917"],"fa":"این یکی نشان می‌دهد صبر کردن بهتر جواب می‌داد","ib":{"f25c68e83b315e2162daf83588c19ebe563d475e":1,"a1fcd49caae5b4aa042ccfcbc6de4366e4e1f917":1},"m":288},{"id":"eurotrash_p12_289","t":"Not a huge fan of Microsoft, worth watching though","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#289","p":12,"im":["df216096dcac8cd9591233c0c1ec640342340679","d9443e4b064dd3aae0d110e10314d281cd927ea0"],"fa":"Microsoft را خیلی دوست ندارم، ولی ارزش زیر نظر گرفتن دارد","ib":{"df216096dcac8cd9591233c0c1ec640342340679":1,"d9443e4b064dd3aae0d110e10314d281cd927ea0":1},"m":289},{"id":"eurotrash_p12_290","t":"How long have you been trading for using the RTM method pal? I note you're very measured, calm and consistent - something I need to work on!","a":"smimon","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#290","p":12,"im":[],"fa":"چقدر است با روش RTM معامله می‌کنی رفیق؟ می‌بینم خیلی سنجیده، آرام و با ثباتی — چیزی که خودم باید روش کار کنم!","m":290},{"id":"eurotrash_p12_291","t":"Man, you like Anaconda of RTM.. consumed all orders..\n\nBH","a":"Blackhawkfx","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#291","p":12,"im":[],"fa":"رابطه‌ات با RTM مثل آنکونداست… همهٔ سفارش‌ها را بلعیده…\n\nBH","m":291},{"id":"eurotrash_p12_292","t":"Hey guys, thanks! I have been trading the RTM for a long time now but took over a year away from the charts as I was in a bad place finacilay and it was playing on my emotions. I just couldn't get it to work. I gave it another look a couple weeks ago. After talking about it with a friend I had a read through the journal and thought I'd give it another shot. Now that the other stuff in my life is on the up trading seems to be clearer. I hope it stays that way!\n\nTook the same ftse as Smimon, I bailed on it though","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#292","p":12,"im":["3c442260c36fc3c8fd4335dab6084667bad0246f"],"fa":"سلام بچه‌ها، ممنون! مدت‌هاست با RTM معامله می‌کنم، ولی بیش از یک سال از چارت‌ها دور بودم چون از نظر مالی جای بدی بودم و روی احساساتم اثر می‌گذاشت. نمی‌توانستم به نتیجه برسم. چند هفته پیش دوباره به آن نگاه کردم. بعد از صحبت درباره‌اش با یک دوست، ژورنال را خواندم و فکر کردم یک شانس دیگر به آن بدهم. حالا که بقیهٔ زندگی‌ام روی رو به بالاست، معامله شفاف‌تر به نظر می‌رسد. امیدوارم همین‌طور بماند!\n\nهمان ftseِ Smimon را گرفتم، ولی از آن خارج شدم","ib":{"3c442260c36fc3c8fd4335dab6084667bad0246f":2},"m":292},{"id":"eurotrash_p12_293","t":"Took the same ftse as Smimon, I bailed on it though\n\nYeah unfortunately went the wrong way - I saw on my phone when I was at the gym that we'd had a surge that broke through the supply area north, and then a RT - I could have got out at b/e but I can't manage my trades on my phone! I need to get VNC server up and running.","a":"smimon","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#293","p":12,"im":[],"fa":"همان ftseِ Smimon را گرفتم، ولی زود از آن خارج شدم\n\nبله، متأسفانه به سمت اشتباه رفت — وقتی در باشگاه بودم روی گوشی دیدم که یک جهش ناحیهٔ عرضهٔ شمال را شکسته و بعد یک RT آمده؛ می‌توانستم در b/e خارج شوم ولی تریدهایم را با موبایل مدیریت نمی‌کنم! باید VNC server را راه بیندازم.","m":293},{"id":"eurotrash_p12_294","t":"smimon wrote:\n\nTook the same ftse as Smimon, I bailed on it though\n\nYeah unfortunately went the wrong way - I saw on my phone when I was at the gym that we'd had a surge that broke through the supply area north, and then a RT - I could have got out at b/e but I can't manage my trades on my phone! I need to get VNC server up and running.\n\nGet team viewer remote control on your mobile. It's very handy.","a":"Blackhawkfx","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#294","p":12,"im":[],"fa":"smimon نوشت:\n\nهمان ftseِ Smimon را گرفتم، ولی زود از آن خارج شدم\n\nبله، متأسفانه به سمت اشتباه رفت — وقتی در باشگاه بودم روی گوشی دیدم که یک جهش ناحیهٔ عرضهٔ شمال را شکسته و بعد یک RT آمده؛ می‌توانستم در b/e خارج شوم ولی تریدهایم را با موبایل مدیریت نمی‌کنم! باید VNC server را راه بیندازم.\n\nTeamViewer را برای کنترل از راه دور روی موبایلت نصب کن. خیلی به کار می‌آید.","m":294},{"id":"eurotrash_p12_295","t":"ftse could have had a better entry","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#295","p":12,"im":["ebf1475f59e30c1a860af909ce2326891642f3ef"],"fa":"ftse می‌توانست ورود بهتری داشته باشد","ib":{"ebf1475f59e30c1a860af909ce2326891642f3ef":1},"m":295},{"id":"eurotrash_p12_296","t":"Watching this one","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#296","p":12,"im":["3a0512c84d63d7afc6d1b7b38ad12b199de95d8b"],"fa":"دارم این یکی را می‌بینم","ib":{"3a0512c84d63d7afc6d1b7b38ad12b199de95d8b":1},"m":296},{"id":"eurotrash_p12_297","t":"EDIT: just fell off a cliff\n\nout of the FTSE, trade management was a bit chaotic as was away from the pc","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#297","p":12,"im":["85423dc02b0276e01cd64858fbe44e04ca972a7d"],"fa":"EDIT: تازه از صخره غلتید\n\nاز FTSE خارج شدم؛ مدیریت معامله کمی به‌هم‌ریخته بود چون از PC دور بودم.","ib":{"85423dc02b0276e01cd64858fbe44e04ca972a7d":2},"m":297},{"id":"eurotrash_p12_298","t":"have a feeling I will be kicking myself for bailing on this one charts.mql5.com/6/204/alu-fr-m15-ava-financial-ltd.png","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#298","p":12,"im":[],"fa":"حس می‌کنم به‌خاطر خروج از این یکی خودم را سرزنش خواهم کرد charts.mql5.com/6/204/alu-fr-m15-ava-financial-ltd.png","m":298},{"id":"eurotrash_p12_299","t":"microsoft","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#299","p":12,"im":["40e92c3d2e0e9689a046c8fa839c91c13c113b20"],"ib":{"40e92c3d2e0e9689a046c8fa839c91c13c113b20":1},"m":299},{"id":"eurotrash_p12_300","t":"This was a bad trade, it turned out good but didn't follow my entry rules, need to keep this in check.","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#300","p":12,"im":["9075096a4b2ec7e07bbf05a32a258ef4f7ba7663"],"fa":"این معامله بدی بود؛ در آخر خوب تمام شد ولی از قوانین ورودم پیروی نکرد، باید این را مهار کنم.","ib":{"9075096a4b2ec7e07bbf05a32a258ef4f7ba7663":1},"m":300}],"images":[{"k":"5d38844b05843333440cb054938f894df22900c1","t":"assets/thumbs/5d38844b05843333440cb054938f894df22900c1.webp","f":"assets/images/5d38844b05843333440cb054938f894df22900c1.webp","w":1500,"h":1020,"b":78420,"o":"5d38844b05843333440cb054938f894df22900c1.jpeg","p":12,"pid":"eurotrash_p12_276"},{"k":"56b9e5637f07b22695600b742baa2ff9013f6ca8","t":"assets/thumbs/56b9e5637f07b22695600b742baa2ff9013f6ca8.webp","f":"assets/images/56b9e5637f07b22695600b742baa2ff9013f6ca8.webp","w":1500,"h":1020,"b":87256,"o":"56b9e5637f07b22695600b742baa2ff9013f6ca8.jpeg","p":12,"pid":"eurotrash_p12_277"},{"k":"1beecda317fc4cbc72b5b06e0c72d5f1712f99ee","t":"assets/thumbs/1beecda317fc4cbc72b5b06e0c72d5f1712f99ee.webp","f":"assets/images/1beecda317fc4cbc72b5b06e0c72d5f1712f99ee.webp","w":1366,"h":1306,"b":85764,"o":"1beecda317fc4cbc72b5b06e0c72d5f1712f99ee.jpeg","p":12,"pid":"eurotrash_p12_278"},{"k":"4e40c1f9529fca8874b39357fd96b034995aeb87","t":"assets/thumbs/4e40c1f9529fca8874b39357fd96b034995aeb87.webp","f":"assets/images/4e40c1f9529fca8874b39357fd96b034995aeb87.webp","w":1500,"h":1020,"b":69054,"o":"4e40c1f9529fca8874b39357fd96b034995aeb87.jpeg","p":12,"pid":"eurotrash_p12_279"},{"k":"f8ffc241fbad76e92323f3a3b4468dd54622ff4f","t":"assets/thumbs/f8ffc241fbad76e92323f3a3b4468dd54622ff4f.webp","f":"assets/images/f8ffc241fbad76e92323f3a3b4468dd54622ff4f.webp","w":1500,"h":1020,"b":71356,"o":"f8ffc241fbad76e92323f3a3b4468dd54622ff4f.jpeg","p":12,"pid":"eurotrash_p12_279"},{"k":"4fc046ad111df724cf359884ca6506bc68a8b314","t":"assets/thumbs/4fc046ad111df724cf359884ca6506bc68a8b314.webp","f":"assets/images/4fc046ad111df724cf359884ca6506bc68a8b